{"rank":1,"title":"The phone layout does not adapt to the screen","target":"one column with no sideways scrolling (page width equal to the 390 px viewport)","fix_direction":"Below tablet width, stack the page into one column with the form directly under the opening text, and fold the menu into a single row or a menu button.","sel":"p.lead"}
{"rank":2,"title":"Nothing leads, and the headline is the weakest text on the page","target":"a headline clearly the first thing seen: larger by a real step than the body, darker than the body, not paler","fix_direction":"Make the headline larger by a real step and darker, and if wanted set it in the Source Serif the logo uses. Then decide whether the 'no agency, no fee' point belongs in it or right under it.","sel":"h1"}
{"rank":3,"title":"Two buttons do the same job, and the stronger one is not the form's button","target":"one primary (filled) action per view, and it is the form's 'Search' button","fix_direction":"Make 'Search' the one filled button, and either remove 'See boats and dates' or give it a different job.","sel":"a.button"}
{"rank":4,"title":"A holiday sold with no picture of it","target":"one real photo of the company's own boats or its stretch of canal where the empty band sits","fix_direction":"The maker supplies one real photo of their own boats or canal and places it in the empty band below the button. A generic photo does not close this.","sel":null}
{"rank":5,"title":"The copy contradicts itself and leaves out the price","target":"headline that matches the 4, 7 and 10 night routes, and a price figure a visitor can compare","fix_direction":"Cut 'for a week' or make it match the shorter breaks. Add a starting price; the maker must supply it from their own price list, since the page has none.","sel":"h1"}
{"rank":null,"title":"Five type sizes, three of them too close to read as separate levels","target":"about three sizes, with weight or color for finer steps","fix_direction":"Keep about three sizes and use weight or color for finer steps.","sel":null}
{"rank":null,"title":"Route lengths and the headline are just under the 4.5:1 contrast minimum","target":"contrast of at least 4.5:1","fix_direction":"Darken the gray #6b7574 slightly.","sel":"h1"}
{"rank":null,"title":"The empty space is scattered, not planned","target":"content held in a centered maximum width, with the dead band closed","fix_direction":"Hold the content in a centered maximum width and close the dead band.","sel":null}

